%t A157893 Select[Table[Append[QuotientRemainder[#1, 2^#2], #2] & @@ {#, IntegerExponent[#, 2]} &[n - 1], {n, 3, 5200, 2}], And[OddQ[#[[1]] ], #[[-1]] >= 1, 2^#[[-1]] > #[[1]] ] &][[All, -1]] (* _Michael De Vlieger_, Nov 04 2019 *)
%o A157893 (Python)
%o A157893 from oeis_sequences.OEISsequences import bisection
%o A157893 def A157893(n):
%o A157893     def f(x): return n+x-sum(min((x-1>>i)+1,1<<i)>>1 for i in range(1,(x-1).bit_length()))
%o A157893     return (~(m:=bisection(f,n,n)-1)& m-1).bit_length() # _Chai Wah Wu_, Sep 15 2026
